    "final_report_title": "研究报告：Python 的无 GIL 自由线程构建从哪个版本开始提供，目前处于什么状态？引用 PEP 和官方文档。",
    "final_report_markdown": "# Python 自由线程（无 GIL）构建的引入版本与当前状态\n\n本次核验的资料显示，自由线程构建在 Python 3.13 中处于实验性阶段，自 Python 3.14 起不再被视为实验性，但尚不是默认解释器构建，其支持状态由 PEP 779 确立，技术细节另见 PEP 703。运行时可选择启用 GIL。\n\n## 直接回答\n\n关于引入版本，本次核验的资料显示，自由线程构建在 Python 3.13 中属于实验性特性，并可能在未来版本中演化为可选（或可能默认禁用）的特性。 [evidence:d6e03e995956b9ee3291a67877f6250bb91ffc0fa17fa309]\n\n## PEP 引用与运行时行为\n\n官方文档将自由线程构建的解释性引用指向 PEP 703，用于了解额外细节。 [evidence:871d005ff473620d28ebbc70f6e08499547d3ceb69d05022]\n\n在运行时，自由线程版本的 CPython 支持通过环境变量选择启用 GIL。 [evidence:bb3c44d05437670e7a2afc3eb522f9330b7820b5e4e76c25]\n\n## 对比表\n\n| 维度 | 事实 |\n| --- | --- |\n| 引入版本 | Python 3.13 中为实验性 [evidence:d6e03e995956b9ee3291a67877f6250bb91ffc0fa17fa309] |\n| 当前状态 | 自 Python 3.14 起不再实验性，尚非默认构建，经 PEP 779 确立官方支持 [evidence:ef1805b9e634b0a223ef75e462fd410d7343e5f0b06abd83] [evidence:980ddaea5e72ba81ffac81f54eb07d7602978b3be85e825b] [evidence:19d264aabeb1590f62a3cf9b89588b6934037d821cea8741] |\n| PEP 引用 | PEP 703 提供额外细节 [evidence:871d005ff473620d28ebbc70f6e08499547d3ceb69d05022] |\n| 运行时 GIL | 可通过环境变量在运行时选择启用 GIL [evidence:bb3c44d05437670e7a2afc3eb522f9330b7820b5e4e76c25] |\n\n## Citation audit\n\n### CPython free-threaded build · introduction version\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:d6e03e995956b9ee3291a67877f6250bb91ffc0fa17fa309`\n- Exact quote: “It was experimental in Python 3.13, eventually evolving into an optional (or possibly default-disabled) feature in future releases.”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/230fdc16-2b32-4344-8734-2b298aa933c9/9dc8ca6a1fb002e0754d0c1bb7d2e0c6788d3fe26a22f233d3220f26c8a8db55`\n- URL: https://www.linkedin.com/pulse/goodbye-gil-exploring-free-threaded-mode-python-314-adarsh-divakaran-a93ac\n\n### CPython free-threaded build · current status\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:ef1805b9e634b0a223ef75e462fd410d7343e5f0b06abd83`\n- Exact quote: “the free-threaded interpreter is no longer considered experimental starting in Python 3.14, although it is not yet the default interpreter build.”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/3a4d915f-d645-4580-a7b9-2fedae54309c/afa3f505ec4ddddc44a7408e9988a8e9d7540894de8b676bf5727e89b71a5900`\n- URL: https://py-free-threading.github.io/\n\n### CPython free-threaded build · official documentation\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:bb3c44d05437670e7a2afc3eb522f9330b7820b5e4e76c25`\n- Exact quote: “Free-threaded builds of CPython support optionally running with the GIL enabled at runtime using the environment variable”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/230fdc16-2b32-4344-8734-2b298aa933c9/543a59a459a0149d2e73a9c99d062252b469d21baf0407b3a664b642792e4570`\n- URL: https://docs.python.org/3/howto/free-threading-python.html\n\n### CPython free-threaded build · PEP reference\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:871d005ff473620d28ebbc70f6e08499547d3ceb69d05022`\n- Exact quote: “See [**PEP 703**](https://peps.python.org/pep-0703/) for additional details.”\n- Snapshot: `research/external/51a43041-7f98-42fa-9c32-d657270aeebd/543a59a459a0149d2e73a9c99d062252b469d21baf0407b3a664b642792e4570`\n- URL: https://docs.python.org/3/howto/free-threading-python.html\n\n## 补充引用\n\n- Evidence: `evidence:980ddaea5e72ba81ffac81f54eb07d7602978b3be85e825b`\n  - Exact quote: “Python 3.14, released in October 2025, graduated that build from experimental to officially supported via PEP 779. It’s not the default yet.”\n  - Snapshot: `research/external/3a4d915f-d645-4580-a7b9-2fedae54309c/733039f0031b3dbb7ee2300ae4117f010b5b7d82e9f682f60849a0a6fa30f08c`\n  - URL: https://medium.com/@yogeshkrishnanseeniraj/free-threaded-python-what-it-actually-means-for-your-code-c8c4023fce2a\n- Evidence: `evidence:19d264aabeb1590f62a3cf9b89588b6934037d821cea8741`\n  - Exact quote: “With [the acceptance](https://discuss.python.org/t/pep-779-criteria-for-supported-status-for-free-threaded-python/84319/123) of [PEP 779 - Criteria for supported status for free-threaded Python](https://peps.python.org/pep-0779/), the free-threaded interpreter is no longer considered experimental”\n  - Snapshot: `research/external/3a4d915f-d645-4580-a7b9-2fedae54309c/afa3f505ec4ddddc44a7408e9988a8e9d7540894de8b676bf5727e89b71a5900`\n  - URL: https://py-free-threading.github.io/\n",
